    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't work though. the breathing stuff and the \"quieting the mind\" stuff... it's just a temporary fix. it's like trying to put a bandaid on a broken dam. the noise always comes back and it's always just as heavy. i feel like i'm constantly drowning in it. i just want a silence that actually lasts. something permanent.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
