    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapists can't fix this. they just talk in circles and it's more noise. i'm just so tired of fighting it every single second of every single day. it's not a storm that passes, it's just my life. i need a way to just... not feel anything. to have absolute, perfect quiet where nothing can ever touch me again.",
